---
/* 承诺观 vs 合规观 · v0.4 双栏对照 */
---

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
  <div class="rounded-sm border border-brass-mid/25 bg-brass-mid/10 p-6 md:p-8">
    <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-brass-bright tracking-cn mb-4">承诺观</h3>
    <dl class="space-y-2 text-sm text-text-soft">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 border-b border-brass-mid/10 pb-2">
        <dt class="text-brass-mid font-serif-en italic text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">性质</dt>
        <dd class="text-cream font-medium tracking-cn text-right">额外承担的事</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 border-b border-brass-mid/10 pb-2">
        <dt class="text-brass-mid font-serif-en italic text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">逻辑</dt>
        <dd class="text-cream font-medium tracking-cn text-right">加法</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 border-b border-brass-mid/10 pb-2">
        <dt class="text-brass-mid font-serif-en italic text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">立场</dt>
        <dd class="text-cream font-medium tracking-cn text-right">超越基线</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 pb-1">
        <dt class="text-brass-mid font-serif-en italic text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">违反</dt>
        <dd class="text-cream font-medium tracking-cn text-right">会 · 公开赔偿</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
    <hr class="border-brass-mid/25 my-4" />
    <p class="text-brass-mid text-xs leading-relaxed tracking-cn">
      例：1% 营收捐赠 · AED · 应急服务
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="rounded-sm border border-coral-mid/35 bg-coral-deep/10 p-6 md:p-8">
    <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-coral-mid tracking-cn mb-4">合规观</h3>
    <dl class="space-y-2 text-sm text-text-soft">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 border-b border-coral-mid/15 pb-2">
        <dt class="text-coral-mid font-serif-en italic text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">性质</dt>
        <dd class="text-cream font-medium tracking-cn text-right">必须遵守的事</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 border-b border-coral-mid/15 pb-2">
        <dt class="text-coral-mid font-serif-en italic text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">逻辑</dt>
        <dd class="text-cream font-medium tracking-cn text-right">减法</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 border-b border-coral-mid/15 pb-2">
        <dt class="text-coral-mid font-serif-en italic text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">立场</dt>
        <dd class="text-cream font-medium tracking-cn text-right">守住基线</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 pb-1">
        <dt class="text-coral-mid font-serif-en italic text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">违反</dt>
        <dd class="text-cream font-medium tracking-cn text-right">不会 · 红线</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
    <hr class="border-coral-mid/25 my-4" />
    <p class="text-coral-mid text-xs leading-relaxed tracking-cn">
      例：不做保护物种 · 不做来源不明 · 不做活体交易
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="my-8 p-6 rounded-sm border border-brass-mid/20 bg-ink-elevated/40 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <p class="text-sm text-text-soft leading-relaxed tracking-cn">
    只有承诺观 · 没有合规观 = 做善事的违法者（伪善）<br />
    只有合规观 · 没有承诺观 = 守法的平庸者（无趣）<br />
    <span class="text-cream font-serif tracking-cn">两个都要 — 这是山海造物的完整立场</span>
  </p>
</div>
